    "tree_id": "19b5e768300c2db27cd3a5fc942f76e694ff2eda",
    "message": "[ipa-delivery:730] build(delivery): private IPA 730 = the delivered 729 with XeniaCore d7ad7e834 (no 8 GB code-region limit) and S2Arm engine 175018a2\n\nFrozen on 4c5763ca (effective digest 94378cd1, 7922 product files). Base: the delivered and verified 729 (run 43195224577).\n- XeniaCore pin 2d176a7f (d7ad7e834, run 43217888486), per session 03:\n  - XeniOS's 8 GB code-region limit lifted for RewindBox's full-width\n    StikJIT; no host reservation, so no launch depends on free low\n    address space;\n  - every JIT attach goes through the full-width StikJIT, or the launch\n    is refused before attach (bridge jitToolUnverified, app\n    jitToolUnsupported);\n  - host pad enumerated for slot 0.\n- S2Arm engine pin 175018a2, per session 04:\n  - rewriter spin pass off on the phone;\n  - guest park and resume of the same game;\n  - notice names the prepare patches; preparation diagnostics.\n- RPCS3 Core 934 and MeloNX Core 743 kept.\nNothing of this build was run on an iPhone; no FPS, memory, heat or\nstability claim.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-12T13:18:31Z",
